<title>LEBANON: Lebanon bank assets rise 2.12 pct in May.</title>
<headline>Lebanon bank assets rise 2.12 pct in May.</headline>
<dateline>BEIRUT 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Total assets of Lebanon's banks rose 2.12 percent in May, the Lebanese Banks Association reported on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The association issued the following banking sector details (in billions of Lebanese pounds, unless otherwise stated):</p>
<p>		    May 97   Apr 97   Mar 97</p>
<p>Total Assets    39,734   38,911   38,237</p>
<p>Month. change (%)  2.12    1.76     2.25</p>
<p>Deposits of Residents and Non-residents</p>
<p>		    33,360   32,553   31,916</p>
<p>Month. change (%)  2.48    2.00     2.00</p>
<p>Claims on Residents and Non-residents</p>
<p>		    13,883   13,661   13,452</p>
<p>Month. change (%)  1.63    1.55     1.43</p>
<p>Total capital    2,227    2,127    2,050</p>
<p>Month. change (%)  4.71    3.74     2.54</p>
<p>-Beirut editorial (961 1) 602057 745308</p>
</text>
